# twow-repo#726 planner fix pair (OB-60 bug review 9f5669b7 of P-2a/2b/3a; OB-10 DECISION 5a445aa4 + Nachtrag 1 1e3b50d1;
# AiPlayerbot.Planner = 2 with Planner.WriteCohort only, default 0). Pinned here:
#   (a) F2: the #416 budget hold of a pick ends with a pick change (key or sinceMs) and MinBindSec after the abort (BudgetHolds,
#       FeedBegin clears feedBudgetKey); no feed skip locks rule 5 (SkipFallback: Budget -> BudgetHeld), only the abort does;
#   (b) F3: an empty quest plan list is FeedEnd::RejectEmpty (fallback_reject_empty, no lock); Q2 (c): a grind pick's empty zone
#       locks once per pick (ZoneEmptySeen), again for the same pick zone_empty_held without a lock;
#   (c) F1: the FeedTakes filter loop is timed (feed_us / feed_us_max, counted in FeedResult);
#   (d) F4: the P-2b seconds keys are read signed and clamped to the nearest bound with one error line (plannerSec), never
#       uint32(config.GetIntDefault(...)) any more;
#   (e) F6: ReasonFor names WriterId::Planner "planner";
#   (f) the unit tests TestFeedFixes726 (planner_shadow_policy_tests) and "reason planner" (supervisor_policy_tests) run.
# Every check_* returns "" when it holds, else the reason; the negative probes at the end reuse them on mutated text.
if(NOT DEFINED PB_SOURCE_DIR)
  message(FATAL_ERROR "a3s3 planner fix726: PB_SOURCE_DIR is required")
endif()
if(NOT DEFINED PB_MODULE_DIR)
  message(FATAL_ERROR "a3s3 planner fix726: PB_MODULE_DIR is required")
